     "The local weight factor is $\\mu_a^c/(\\bar{\\mu}P_a^c) = 1$, so $w$ remains unchanged.",
     "* Else if $\\xi < P_a^c + P_s^c$: Control scattering.",
     "The local weight factor is $\\mu_s^c/(\\bar{\\mu}P_s^c) = 1$.",
     "* Else if $\\xi < P_a^c + P_s^c + P_a^r(\\mathbf{x})$: Residual absorption.",
     "Update $w \\leftarrow w \\cdot \\mu_a^r(\\mathbf{x})/(\\bar{\\mu}P_a^r(\\mathbf{x}))$.",
     "* Else if $\\xi < P_a^c + P_s^c + P_a^r(\\mathbf{x}) + P_s^r(\\mathbf{x})$: Residual scattering.",
     "Update $w \\leftarrow w \\cdot \\mu_s^r(\\mathbf{x})/(\\bar{\\mu}P_s^r(\\mathbf{x}))$.",
     "Update $w \\leftarrow w \\cdot \\mu_n(\\mathbf{x})/(\\bar{\\mu}P_n(\\mathbf{x}))$.",
     "*   **Non-Bounding Control:** If $\\mu_t^c > \\mu_t(\\mathbf{x})$ at some point, $\\mu_n(\\mathbf{x})$ becomes negative.",
